{
  "$comment": "跨仓库 golden fixtures 的清单。两侧 CI 都读这个文件，不要各自维护一份用例表——用例表分叉就是副本漂移的老毛病换个地方复发。字段含义见 fixtures/README.md 与 CONSUMER-TESTS.md。",
  "contract": "a2a-streaming-contract.md",
  "contract_version": "v1.11",
  "cases": [
    {"id": "dp-valid-01", "group": "A", "file": "data-part/valid/01-success-single-step.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "usable_as_source",
     "why": "正常查库成功：三布尔齐全且为 false/true 的可信组合，单步 success=true 有行"},

    {"id": "dp-valid-02", "group": "A", "file": "data-part/valid/02-conversation-route.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "对话路径：queried_database=false。schema 通过，但那段 answer 是模型说的话不是数据，不得当出处（§4.6.1 的 not_applicable）"},

    {"id": "dp-valid-03", "group": "A", "file": "data-part/valid/03-cross-database-two-steps.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "usable_as_source",
     "why": "跨库两步全成功。第二步 row_count=0 但 success=true——不影响整体可用"},

    {"id": "dp-valid-04", "group": "D", "file": "data-part/valid/04-unlisted-database.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "usable_as_source",
     "why": "清单外但形状合法的标识符 hr_db。v1.6 起新增库不算契约变更，所以这是**常规路径不是异常路径**：调用方必须照常采信，中文映射退化为显示原始标识符，不得崩溃、不得因为不认识就判不可信"},

    {"id": "dp-bad-01", "group": "B", "file": "data-part/schema-invalid/01-missing-has-risk.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "invalid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "缺 has_risk。§9.1 缺口的核心用例：调用方今天会把它当成「无风险」并采信（fail-open）。必须校验失败，且回落判定必须是不可信"},

    {"id": "dp-bad-02", "group": "B", "file": "data-part/schema-invalid/02-missing-degraded.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "invalid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "缺 degraded。同上，方向同样是反的"},

    {"id": "dp-bad-03", "group": "B", "file": "data-part/schema-invalid/03-string-boolean.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "invalid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "三个布尔都是字符串 \"true\"/\"false\"。bool(\"false\") 为真——字面写着 false 的字段会被读成 True"},

    {"id": "dp-bad-04", "group": "B", "file": "data-part/schema-invalid/04-missing-all-three-booleans.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "invalid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "三个全缺。最像「服务端换了版本 / 序列化坏了」的形态"},

    {"id": "dp-bad-05", "group": "B", "file": "data-part/schema-invalid/05-step-success-with-error.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "invalid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "success=true 同时带 error 字符串，自相矛盾（§4.6.2：error 为 null ⟺ success 为 true）"},

    {"id": "dp-bad-06", "group": "D", "file": "data-part/schema-invalid/06-database-id-wrong-shape.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "invalid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "database 写成 \"ERP\"，不符合 ^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*_db$。调用方的中文映射会静默退化成显示原始串"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-01", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/01-failed-step.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "**本组的核心用例。** 唯一一步 success=false，但 queried_database=true、has_risk=false、degraded=false——今天的三布尔判据会把它判成可信。execution_status 应为 failed"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-02", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/02-partial-success.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "partial",
     "why": "两步一成一败。execution_status 应为 partial_success：成功那步的数据是真的，不该整段丢，但也不能当完整答案"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-03", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/03-has-risk.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "has_risk=true（semantic_mismatch）。SQL 跑通了、有结果，但答的不是问的那件事"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-04", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/04-degraded-history-replay.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "degraded=true，历史 SQL 重放。state 仍是 completed（§4.6.8 保留这一点），所以只能靠这个字段区分"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-05", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/05-truncated.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "partial",
     "why": "truncated=true，10000 行封顶。数据本身可用，但任何「共有 N 条 / 全部 / 一共」的表述都不成立（§4.6.3）"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-06", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/06-no-data.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "no_data",
     "why": "查成功了，零行。必须与 failed 分开——「查到了，答案是没有」和「没查成」对客户是两句不同的话（§4.6.1）"},

    {"id": "dp-trust-07", "group": "C", "file": "data-part/trust-negative/07-failed-step-with-status.json",
     "schema": "schema/artifact-data-part.schema.json", "expect": "valid",
     "trust": "not_usable",
     "why": "与 dp-trust-01 同一份载荷，但**带着** execution_status。两条一起构成 §4.6.7 过渡判据的完整覆盖：01 走推导路径（status_source=derived），07 走契约路径（status_source=contract）。两条都必过——进度标记不挂在 fixture 上，见 CONSUMER-TESTS 的 C 组"},

    {"id": "pe-valid-01", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/valid/01-routing.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "valid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "不重复的 stage，metadata 只有 stage + trace_id"},

    {"id": "pe-valid-02", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/valid/02-execution-with-step-and-database.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "valid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "按 step 重复的 stage，带 step 与 database"},

    {"id": "pe-valid-03", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/valid/03-repair-step-2.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "valid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "repair 带 step=2。调用方的「同一个 step 收到第二个 repair = 服务端有 bug」判据要靠这个字段"},

    {"id": "pe-bad-01", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/schema-invalid/01-missing-stage.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "invalid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "缺 stage。stage 是契约面里唯一的机器可读标识，缺了整条事件没有意义"},

    {"id": "pe-bad-02", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/schema-invalid/02-unknown-stage.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "invalid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "stage=memory_context——§4.5 明确「内部有而契约不暴露」。发出来说明服务端漏了过滤"},

    {"id": "pe-bad-03", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/schema-invalid/03-final-true.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "invalid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "进度事件的 final 恒为 false（§4.3）。final=true 却 state=working 会让调用方提前认为流结束"},

    {"id": "pe-bad-04", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/schema-invalid/04-execution-without-step.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "invalid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "会重复的 stage 不带 step。缺了它，「repair 的 step 必须严格递增」那条判据就无法执行"},

    {"id": "pe-bad-05", "group": "E", "file": "progress-event/schema-invalid/05-metadata-carries-post-hoc-field.json",
     "schema": "schema/progress-event.schema.json", "expect": "invalid", "trust": "n/a",
     "why": "把 route/confidence 塞进了进度事件。它们要到 stage 结束才有值——出现即说明服务端把事后信息当成了事前信息（§4.5 的诚实说明）"}
  ]
}
